# sundev.pl — Project Context

Personal-professional micro blog at **sundev.pl**, hosted on **Kylos Silver** shared hosting (Apache, PHP available, no persistent Node.js). Built with **Astro** in static output mode — content authored in Markdown, deployed as pre-built HTML.

## Stack
- **Astro** with `output: 'static'`
- **TypeScript** strict mode
- **Content Collections** for blog posts and articles
- **GitHub Actions** CI/CD: push to `main` → build → rsync to Kylos Silver via SSH

## Publishing Workflow
```
write .md → git push main → GitHub Actions → Kylos
```
- `main` = production; every push deploys
- `draft: true` frontmatter = excluded from build
- `draft/post-name` branches = unpublished work

## Project Layout
```
src/
  content/
    blog/       ← short posts (.md)
    articles/   ← long-form articles (.md)
  pages/        ← .astro route files
  layouts/      ← BaseLayout.astro and variants
  styles/       ← global.css only
public/         ← static assets
dist/           ← build output (gitignored, deploy this)
```

## Rules
- Static-first: no `client:` directives unless truly needed
- Semantic HTML5, accessible by default
- Images via `astro:assets` `<Image>` for optimization
- No `any` in TypeScript
- All content frontmatter: `title`, `date` (ISO 8601), `description`, `draft` (bool)
- `draft: true` entries excluded from production build
- Scoped component styles preferred over global
- Keep CSS simple — no utility-class sprawl unless Tailwind is explicitly adopted
